menu "miniesp"

    config MINIESP_BENCH
        bool "Benchmark syscall (sys_bench, used by the esp-bench package)"
        default n
        help
            Adds the native benchmark kernels and the second-core worker. Off in the standard image: it is not needed to run a tank
            controller (wtms), MQTT or pkg, and costs flash. The PSRAM variant turns it on. Without it an esp-bench program fails to load.

endmenu
